---
interface Props {
  kind?: 'open' | 'scope';
}

const { kind = 'scope' } = Astro.props;
---

{kind === 'open' ? (
  <figure
    class="not-prose my-6 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50/70 p-4 sm:p-6 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/50"
    aria-label="打开项目的正确做法与错误做法及对应结果对比图"
  >
    <div class="mb-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
      <span class="font-semibold tracking-wide text-zinc-700 uppercase dark:text-zinc-300">First Launch</span>
      <span>方式 → 结果对比</span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <!-- 正确做法 -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/35 bg-white p-4 shadow-xs dark:bg-zinc-950/80">
        <div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="inline-flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-xs font-bold text-white">✓</span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">正确做法</span>
          </div>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-500/15 dark:text-emerald-300">
            先定范围，再验证
          </span>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs">
          <li class="rounded-lg border border-emerald-200/80 bg-emerald-50/40 p-3 dark:border-emerald-500/25 dark:bg-emerald-950/20">
            <div class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">打开项目根目录 <code class="font-mono">my-app/</code></div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300">→ 准确读到项目指令与技能，文件边界清晰</div>
          </li>
          <li class="rounded-lg border border-emerald-200/80 bg-emerald-50/40 p-3 dark:border-emerald-500/25 dark:bg-emerald-950/20">
            <div class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">启动后先发只读请求核对路径与 <code class="font-mono">README.md</code></div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300">→ 确认开对项目再动手，避免误改文件</div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 错误做法 -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-rose-500/35 bg-white p-4 shadow-xs dark:bg-zinc-950/80">
        <div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="inline-flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-rose-500 text-xs font-bold text-white">✕</span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">错误做法</span>
          </div>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-rose-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-rose-700 dark:bg-rose-500/15 dark:text-rose-300">
            常见踩坑
          </span>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs">
          <li class="rounded-lg border border-rose-200/80 bg-rose-50/40 p-3 dark:border-rose-500/25 dark:bg-rose-950/20">
            <div class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">开在上一级目录（如 <code class="font-mono">~/Downloads</code>、<code class="font-mono">~/</code>）</div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-rose-800 dark:text-rose-300">→ 读不到项目指令，还容易扫到无关文件夹</div>
          </li>
          <li class="rounded-lg border border-rose-200/80 bg-rose-50/40 p-3 dark:border-rose-500/25 dark:bg-rose-950/20">
            <div class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">开在子目录（如 <code class="font-mono">my-app/src</code>）</div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-rose-800 dark:text-rose-300">→ 缺少根目录上下文，改动容易局限在局部</div>
          </li>
          <li class="rounded-lg border border-rose-200/80 bg-rose-50/40 p-3 dark:border-rose-500/25 dark:bg-rose-950/20">
            <div class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">刚打开就直接让 Agent 改代码</div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-rose-800 dark:text-rose-300">→ 目录选错时会直接改动其他项目文件</div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
      图 1：启动 Agent 时的正确做法与错误做法对比——选对项目根目录并先做只读确认，才能避免漏读配置或改错文件
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
) : (
  <figure
    class="not-prose my-6 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50/70 p-4 sm:p-6 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/50"
    aria-label="全局与项目范围的指令正文、技能简介和技能正文加载时机示意图"
  >
    <div class="mb-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
      <span class="font-semibold tracking-wide text-zinc-700 uppercase dark:text-zinc-300">Scope × Loading Timing</span>
      <span>两个范围 · 两个加载时机</span>
    </div>

    <!-- 阶段一：启动会话时加载 -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-sky-500/30 bg-white p-4 shadow-xs dark:bg-zinc-950/80">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="inline-flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sky-500 text-xs font-bold text-white">1</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">启动会话时加载</span>
        </div>
        <span class="rounded-full bg-sky-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-sky-700 dark:bg-sky-500/15 dark:text-sky-300">
          每次开新会话即占上下文
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-3 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <!-- 全局范围 -->
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-indigo-200/80 bg-indigo-50/50 p-3 dark:border-indigo-500/25 dark:bg-indigo-950/25">
          <div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-900 dark:text-indigo-200">全局范围</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-indigo-700/80 dark:text-indigo-300/80">用户主目录 ~/ · 跨项目</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
            <li class="rounded-md border border-indigo-200/70 bg-white px-2.5 py-2 dark:border-indigo-500/20 dark:bg-zinc-900/80">
              <div class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">指令正文（全文）</div>
              <div class="mt-0.5 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">个人通用约定，如默认用简体中文回复</div>
            </li>
            <li class="rounded-md border border-indigo-200/70 bg-white px-2.5 py-2 dark:border-indigo-500/20 dark:bg-zinc-900/80">
              <div class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">技能简介（仅元数据）</div>
              <div class="mt-0.5 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">仅载入名称与描述，不读正文</div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 项目范围 -->
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-amber-200/80 bg-amber-50/50 p-3 dark:border-amber-500/25 dark:bg-amber-950/25">
          <div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200">项目范围</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-amber-700/80 dark:text-amber-300/80">项目根目录 ./ · 随仓库共享</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
            <li class="rounded-md border border-amber-200/70 bg-white px-2.5 py-2 dark:border-amber-500/20 dark:bg-zinc-900/80">
              <div class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">指令正文（全文）</div>
              <div class="mt-0.5 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">团队项目规范，如改完运行测试命令</div>
            </li>
            <li class="rounded-md border border-amber-200/70 bg-white px-2.5 py-2 dark:border-amber-500/20 dark:bg-zinc-900/80">
              <div class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">技能简介（仅元数据）</div>
              <div class="mt-0.5 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">仅载入名称与描述，不读正文</div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 触发连接桥 -->
    <div class="my-2.5 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
      <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-zinc-800"></span>
      <span class="rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-white px-3 py-0.5 text-center font-medium text-zinc-600 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300">
        ↓ 任务命中技能简介，或手动调用（如 /技能名、$技能名、/skill:技能名）
      </span>
      <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-zinc-800"></span>
    </div>

    <!-- 阶段二：触发任务时按需加载 -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-white p-4 shadow-xs dark:bg-zinc-950/80">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="inline-flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-xs font-bold text-white">2</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">遇到相关任务时按需加载</span>
        </div>
        <span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-500/15 dark:text-emerald-300">
          用到才读，平时不占上下文
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-3 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-indigo-200/80 bg-indigo-50/40 px-3 py-2.5 text-xs dark:border-indigo-500/25 dark:bg-indigo-950/20">
          <div class="font-semibold text-indigo-950 dark:text-indigo-100">命中的全局技能正文</div>
          <div class="mt-0.5 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">读取对应全局技能的 SKILL.md 完整步骤与附带参考</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-amber-200/80 bg-amber-50/40 px-3 py-2.5 text-xs dark:border-amber-500/25 dark:bg-amber-950/20">
          <div class="font-semibold text-amber-950 dark:text-amber-100">命中的项目技能正文</div>
          <div class="mt-0.5 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">读取对应项目技能的 SKILL.md 完整步骤与附带参考</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
      图 2：全局与项目两层配置的加载分工——指令正文与技能简介启动即入上下文，技能正文在命中或手动调用后按需读取
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
)}
